{
 "section": "7",
 "chunks": [
  {
   "id": 64,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/motion/s07_chapter_the_funeral_nobody_believed.mp4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/motion/s07_route_taean_to_shandong.mp4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "typewriter",
     "name": "s07_tw_may_2012",
     "args": {
      "text": "MAY 2012",
      "sub": "KOREAN POLICE MADE AN ANNOUNCEMENT",
      "dur": 3.0,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 65,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/cards/zoom/card_06_police_death_announcement_zoom.mp4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_emergency_records",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "Chinese emergency-care records",
       "and a death certificate"
      ],
      "kicker": "POLICE SAID THEY HAD FOUND",
      "red": [
       "certificate"
      ],
      "dur": 5.0,
      "stagger": 0.9,
      "size": 108,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s01_daegu_skyline_2.jpg",
     "fx": "in"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 66,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "They pointed to a video of his funeral,\nreportedly filmed by family members.",
     "style": "quote"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s07_qingdao_1.jpg",
     "fx": "out"
    },
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_cremated_within_days",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "cremated in China within days,",
       "his ashes brought back to Korea",
       "before the end of December."
      ],
      "kicker": "ACCORDING TO KOREAN REPORTING AT THE TIME",
      "red": [
       "cremated"
      ],
      "dur": 5.5,
      "stagger": 1.0,
      "size": 100,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s03_busan_1.jpg",
     "fx": "left"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 67,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "And Korean authorities only found out about it\nfive months later.",
     "style": "quote"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 68,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_no_body_to_test",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "The public didn't buy it.",
       "Cremation meant there was no body to test."
      ],
      "red": [
       "body"
      ],
      "dur": 4.5,
      "stagger": 1.6,
      "size": 100,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s04_police_korea_2.jpg",
     "fx": "right"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "Police: the death had not been confirmed\none hundred percent.",
     "style": "quote"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 69,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_remember_paper",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "Remember",
       "that piece of paper?"
      ],
      "red": [
       "paper?"
      ],
      "dur": 3.0,
      "stagger": 0.5,
      "size": 120,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "In 2015, victims' groups pointed to\na Chinese cremation document.",
     "style": "quote"
    },
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/motion/s07_typewriter_cremation_dates.mp4"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 70,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s07_qingdao_1.jpg",
     "fx": "in"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s07_weihai_3.jpg",
     "fx": "out"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "A man who said he was a former aide\nreportedly told Korean media",
     "style": "quote"
    },
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_aide_phone_call",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "he had spoken with Cho on the phone",
       "after the date of his supposed death."
      ],
      "kicker": "REPORTEDLY",
      "red": [
       "phone"
      ],
      "dur": 6.0,
      "stagger": 1.4,
      "size": 100,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 71,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "There were rumors\nof plastic surgery,\nof a new name...",
     "style": "quote"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s07_qingdao_1.jpg",
     "fx": "left"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s03_busan_3.jpg",
     "fx": "right"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 72,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/motion/s07_keyphrase_never_proven.mp4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "After all, this was a case where officials\nhad already been caught taking money.",
     "style": "quote"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s01_daegu_skyline_4.jpg",
     "fx": "in"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s03_market_korea_1.jpg",
     "fx": "out"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 73,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "typewriter",
     "name": "s07_tw_oct10_2015_wuxi",
     "args": {
      "text": "OCTOBER 10, 2015 — WUXI, CHINA",
      "sub": "Chinese police arrested Kang Tae-yong, the right-hand man",
      "dur": 5.0,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s01_massage_device_3.jpg",
     "fx": "left"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s01_daegu_skyline_2.jpg",
     "fx": "right"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "Arriving at the prosecutors' office in Daegu,\nhe was asked by reporters\nif Cho was alive.",
     "style": "quote"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 74,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_seen_cho_dead",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "He said he had seen Cho dead",
       "with his own eyes."
      ],
      "kicker": "KANG TAE-YONG",
      "red": [
       "dead"
      ],
      "dur": 5.0,
      "stagger": 1.0,
      "size": 112,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 75,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/cards/zoom/card_07_prosecutors_conclusion_zoom.mp4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s07_weihai_3.jpg",
     "fx": "in"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "Prosecutors said Cho died at a hospital\nin the early hours of December 19th, 2011.",
     "style": "quote"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 76,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_consistent_testimony",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "consistent testimony",
       "from people who were with him,"
      ],
      "kicker": "PROSECUTORS SAID THEY HAD",
      "red": [
       "consistent"
      ],
      "dur": 4.0,
      "stagger": 0.9,
      "size": 112,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "count_up",
     "name": "s07_count_14_funeral",
     "args": {
      "to": 14,
      "kicker": "AND FROM",
      "label": "PEOPLE AT THE FUNERAL",
      "dur": 3.5,
      "count_time": 1.5,
      "size": 230,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_dna_hair",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "a DNA test on hair",
       "matched Cho,"
      ],
      "kicker": "THEY SAID",
      "red": [
       "DNA"
      ],
      "dur": 4.0,
      "stagger": 0.9,
      "size": 118,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "Prosecutors said the funeral video\nshowed no signs of editing.",
     "style": "quote"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 77,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_no_evidence_alive",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "they had found no evidence",
       "that he was alive."
      ],
      "kicker": "PROSECUTORS SAID",
      "red": [
       "evidence"
      ],
      "dur": 5.0,
      "stagger": 1.0,
      "size": 112,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 78,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/motion/s07_stamp_case_closed.mp4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "Some victims' groups rejected that conclusion\nand said they would keep searching.",
     "style": "quote"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s01_daegu_skyline_4.jpg",
     "fx": "out"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 79,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "motion",
     "fn": "key_phrase",
     "name": "s07_kp_strand_of_hair",
     "args": {
      "lines": [
       "a strand of hair proves who it came from,",
       "not whether that person is still alive."
      ],
      "kicker": "SOME VICTIMS' GROUPS ARGUED",
      "red": [
       "alive."
      ],
      "dur": 5.5,
      "stagger": 2.0,
      "size": 96,
      "footer": "PAPER TIGER FILES  ·  EP.02  CHO HEE-PAL"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s03_busan_3.jpg",
     "fx": "left"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 80,
   "segments": [
    {
     "kind": "clip",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/motion/s07_keyphrase_is_he_dead.mp4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "text": "The official answer from Korean authorities is yes.\nThe doubts have never been proven.",
     "style": "quote"
    },
    {
     "kind": "photo",
     "asset": "assets/ep02_cho_hee_pal/s03_busan_1.jpg",
     "fx": "right"
    }
   ]
  }
